WEBVTT

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.710
But like I said, I wasn't a zom—

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:10.710
Right.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:12.780
Right...

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.840
Goodbye.

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:43.290
You must've been through hell.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:50.710
I'm back!

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:07.080
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:07.080
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.580
I decided this myself

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.580
I decided that relying on chance

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:19.090
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:24.050
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:29.970
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:34.890
I try to keep my future in my crosshairs,

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:39.190
and even though my aim is unsteady,

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:42.530
I will hold my head high

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.200
I'll change my life,

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.240
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:55.080
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:55.080 --> 00:02:01.000
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:07.720
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:24.830
High School Division   Twelfth Grade   Kashima Sonora

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:24.830
High School Division    Tenth Grade      Yamato Yura

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.830
They suddenly discharged you?

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.950
An early discharge, yeah.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:30.790
And thus the feast ends.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.650
I ran home just because I could.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.880
30 km makes a nice warm-up.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:34.920
You don't let up, do you?

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:39.260
Did you have fun at the 24-hour tournament?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.860
Honoka sent me a text saying you'd won.

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:44.680
I almost exploded with pride!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.870
Everyone was on point.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:51.190
Winning was almost a sure thing.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.430
Ooh, shots fired!

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:58.620
You sayin' the club was doin' just fine without me?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.580
No, I didn't mean that!

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.830
If you were there... I'm sure...

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.900
Hey, I was kidding.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.930
Don't give me that wounded seal look.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:10.990
Okay...

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:15.480
But for real, what was it like?

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:18.450
I couldn't watch the broadcast from my hospital room,

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:19.870
so give me the details.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:26.920
Well, the flags were dropped from a chopper.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.100
After that...

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.400
Hey, Sono!

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:38.230
What a pleasure to see you again!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.700
She got an early discharge.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.890
Wow!

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:44.200
Weren't you supposed to spend three weeks there?

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.430
The doc's diagnosis was made for civvies.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:50.280
Nobody knows my body better than me.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.380
And Recovery = Discharge.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:55.050
You're as tough as a bear!

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:58.710
I'm just happy you're back!

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.930
Welcome back, Sono!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.930
It's great to be back, Karira!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.330
<i>No, I didn't mean that!</i>

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.870
<i>If you were there...</i>

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.600
<i>I'm sure I wouldn't have been a zombie.</i>

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:28.880
<i>Or, maybe...</i>

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:39.960
Stella Girls' Academy C³ Club

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:39.960
Winner

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:39.960
24-Hour Survival Games

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.400
Whoa, the gold trophy!

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.260
It's huge!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.190
Ain't it awesome?

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:51.550
Wasn't it beautiful how the pellets were glittering at night?

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:54.360
Yes, the fluorescent pellets were beautiful.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.430
But man, it was tough at night!

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:00.710
Didn't you sleepwalk the flag back?

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.450
Sorry I took so long.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.320
Hey, Yura!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.840
You didn't tell me this yesterday, but I hear you beat Rin in a duel?

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.630
That's amazing.

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:17.190
I want to talk about that.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:24.620
The reason we won against Rin was because I fought as a zombie.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.090
Yura, what do you mean?

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.910
A stray bullet aimed in Hono's direction hit me.

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:38.650
But I didn't announce the hit and shot Rin.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.480
So we didn't really win.

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.040
Serious?

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.830
What?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.500
Are you serious?

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:51.750
But everyone heard Rin say she got hit loud and clear!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:58.110
Yeah! If you'd cheated, there's no way she would have stayed quiet.

00:05:58.110 --> 00:05:59.960
Exactly, Yura.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:03.020
I'm sure you heard something else getting hit.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.700
But it's the truth.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:10.010
I'm so sorry!

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.600
But...

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:15.980
Won't they annul our victory then?

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:23.300
Actually, the tournament organizers called me yesterday.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:27.280
What did they say?

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:33.160
They'll ask Meisei what they think happened, and give us another call today.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:35.470
But...

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:40.550
Why did you keep something this important from us?

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.960
Don't just leave us out of the loop!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.170
No, I remember nothing of the sort.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.120
Yes.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:03.810
I observed no breach of the rules whatsoever on part of Stella Girls' Academy.

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.780
It was nice speaking to you.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.820
Rin, is something wrong?

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.970
No, nothing.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:17.560
I see.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.800
Incidentally, I didn't tell you to be at ease.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.550
Stand up straight.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:24.500
Right!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.050
Right.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.020
Right.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.500
I see. Thank you for your time.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.750
What'd the organizers say?

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:42.320
Did Meisei say you were a zombie?

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:48.450
No, they said we broke no rules whatsoever.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.500
Thank goodness!

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.150
That's nice.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:56.530
So, they won't annul our victory, right?

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.290
They won't.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.750
So they said.

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.520
Geez, you really has us goin'!

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:05.290
But...

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.360
I'm sure it's the truth! I—

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.550
Stop worrying about it, Yura.

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:15.390
Even our opponents said we didn't break any rules.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.810
But you need to learn not to keep your problems secret, okay?

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.150
I wasn't keeping them secret.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:24.710
Then you should have asked us for help.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:32.740
I want to get a rematch and fight Rin again.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.310
But...

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.740
Well...

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.460
Why not?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.770
We may have won on paper,

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:44.490
but that kind of win just doesn't feel right!

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.000
Maybe it's hypocritical of me to say this no—

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:47.830
Right now...

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:51.130
a rematch is out of the question.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.010
But...

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.590
I just can't accept this!

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.360
Yura, look...

00:08:58.360 --> 00:08:59.930
Look, Yura.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.250
I suppose now's the time to say this.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.540
You took the tournament far too seriously.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.530
The matches felt far too stressful to be fun.

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:10.590
But...

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:14.240
Did you notice Rento getting hurt during the tournament?

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:16.790
I...

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:17.900
Yeah!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:21.510
She got hurt trying not to let you down!

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.140
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:25.290
I'm fine.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.640
We want to have fun while playing airsoft.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:32.820
We won't have a rematch if it'll be anything like that night.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:35.040
Not against Meisei or anyone else.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:38.310
But...

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.970
I want to fight.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.570
Yura, you little broa—

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:46.340
Yura.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.340
This isn't a battlefield.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.540
Put the gun down.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:50.900
And calm down, Karira.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:10:00.030
Let's say you really were a zombie.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:04.450
You know what you did was wrong, so you can just let it go.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:08.640
It's not rare for a beginner to make a mistake.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:10.830
Just make sure it never happens again.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.550
Besides, nobody but you knows about the zombie thing, right?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.260
I still know.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.430
There she goes.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:40.680
Huh?

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.680
What's with the bonsai?

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.590
Oh, that.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:48.160
Rin gave it to me while I was in the hospital.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.290
The hospital wouldn't keep it, so I brought it here.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:54.160
<i>It's a shame you're not in the tournament.</i>

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.780
<i>That tenth-grader you're so fond of has grown so much, too.</i>

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:04.350
Is something the matter?

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.640
It's bad luck to bring a hospital patient a potted plant.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:10.730
Because the plant never leaves the pot.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.810
What?

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.530
Man, she's a bitch.

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.320
Really?

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.530
Oh well, I got discharged anyway.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.510
Not even bad luck can touch you, huh?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.830
Meisei
Girls'
Academy.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.830
Meisei
Girls'
Academy.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:00.390
Um...

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.900
I had a feeling you'd come.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:05.900
You've improved a great deal.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.420
I didn't recognize you.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:10.870
Why did you announce your hit?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.760
When you called your hit...

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.920
you made me into a zombie.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:20.470
You're a strange one.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.880
I thought you wanted to beat me.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:24.930
I...

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.430
You certainly seemed to, at least.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.850
Anyway, will you fight me again?

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.690
Right here, right now.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.260
Right now?

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:42.000
Life is a battlefield.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:49.120
I have a high opinion of your willingness to get your hands dirty.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.700
Think about yourself.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.540
About what you are.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:16.660
It's a masterpiece!

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:29.030
I'm ready over here!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.780
More juice!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:33.120
Condiments and drinks are over here.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.330
All right, grab your guns!

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:40.340
No hits, no eating!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.220
Ready.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.280
Go!

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:50.270
Strike!

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:52.160
Mine's the one with the yellow tape.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.390
Mine's red.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.400
Aw, you're lucky!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.890
All right.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.340
Here it comes!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.090
Huh?

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:06.310
Oh, that's ramen.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.720
So...

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:09.630
An egg!

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.090
Bamboo shoots too?

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:13.120
Roasted pork?!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.920
All right, finally!

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:24.380
Congratulations.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.040
All right!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.770
Finally got your fine noodles.

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:46.280
All she wanted was her fine noodles.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.280
I wonder if Yura will join us...

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:54.120
She will if she feels like it.

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.180
Hit the spot!

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:01.920
Sonora!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.410
You're dead!

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:05.150
Sorriez.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:12.160
Yura.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:17.390
If you're not hungry, do you at least want tea?

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:20.370
Please.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.520
I'll leave it here.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.610
<i>What I want isn't noodles.</i>

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:30.650
<i>It's airsoft.</i>

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:33.530
Huh?

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.200
Are you going home, Yura?

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:39.430
She's had a long day.

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:41.660
We should just leave her be.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:44.960
Yeah, she'll be just fine tomorrow.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.020
On to our next story.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.730
A serial shooting suspect has been arrested.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:09.740
Suspect Apprehended

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:09.730
The suspect fired at high school girls using an illegally modified airgun, but was recently arrested.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:13.130
Thank goodness he's off the streets, right?

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.880
<i>I guess I knew it all along.</i>

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:18.300
Aiding in his arrest was a high school girl, Haruna Rin,

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:20.250
Suspect Apprehended

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:20.250
who we have live at the crime scene.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.040
Rin?

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.390
Were you scared?

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:25.490
Not really.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:29.210
But you knew he was carrying a gun, right?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:33.760
If you become one with the world, your bullets will find their mark even without aim.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.050
This was no different.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:44.520
Suspect Apprehended

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.710
May I leave now?

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.520
Oh, thank you, that was very informative!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:45.510
Coming up...

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.520
What she said just now...

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:51.750
<i>To achieve success, you need to see everything as one.</i>

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.820
<i>The pellet will hit if you become one with the world.</i>

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:58.580
I see.

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:08.500
Those noodles were delicious, but maybe I ate too much.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.200
And you didn't eat just noodles.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.700
How much was there again?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:17.390
I ate about ten, so all in all, I think fifty?

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.280
And that's just noodles.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:21.850
I'm not as young as I used to be.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:24.420
I can't believe I couldn't handle more.

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:27.130
This isn't a battle.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.900
It is!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.590
A battle against myself!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.890
How many trash bags are left?

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:41.460
Four, I think?

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.410
All right, let's get this over with!

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:47.420
I want to talk. Can we
meet at the shrine
where you taught me?

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:47.420
I'll be there in an hour.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:47.420
Thank you. I'm waiting next to the archery range.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.590
Huh? Are you taking a detour, Sono?

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.870
Yeah, I ate too much.

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:13.430
I've gotta jog it off.

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:15.340
Anyone want to tag along?

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:17.860
A day isn't complete without some exercise.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:20.210
No way.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.780
You're crazy.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:24.470
So long.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.410
Take care!

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.450
<i>Yura...</i>

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.180
You came quickly.

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:52.520
I guess.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:55.980
I can run faster than a bullet train if I want to.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.170
I see.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:01.360
Why the long face?

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:03.380
Is it the pain of love?

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.150
You should tell—

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:06.310
What kind of person was Rin?

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.530
Who was she to you?

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.710
Please tell me!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.060
I want to know!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.210
I can't move on if I don't know.

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:26.440
She... Rin's my friend.

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:28.220
Used to be my partner.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:32.370
When I met Rin in America, she was less sociable than she is now.

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:34.780
Gloomier, you could say.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:38.090
She didn't know any English and had a pretty hard time.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:47.740
But she changed after she met my teacher and started playing airsoft.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:51.460
Airsoft isn't about brawns or manners.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.070
She laughed and smiled a lot back then.

00:19:58.070 --> 00:19:59.460
But...

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:04.340
when our teacher fell on the battlefield...

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:21.460
she became convinced that it was weakness that killed him.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:24.830
She changed again.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:31.790
That's why she always fights for victory.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:40.260
I was bad at talking to people until I joined the C3 club, too.

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.810
But I'm different now.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:49.510
I could change thanks to you.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:59.500
I didn't do any—

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:01.090
I grew stronger!

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:02.860
I gained confidence!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:07.660
That's why I want to continue walking the path I started on!

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:13.790
Then do that.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:16.800
Is that all?

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:26.270
If you become one with the world, your bullets will find their mark even without aim.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:45.030
But if the C3 club can't expand my world,

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:51.080
then I have no reason to continue as its member.

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:11.060
Command!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.930
Control!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.190
Communication!

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.230
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:16.850
Yay!

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:20.070
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:23.400
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:28.530
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.620
Yay!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:36.750
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.580
but that's fine

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:41.710
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:42.710
Ready?

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.220
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:48.260
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.970
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.060
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:55.980
All right?

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.600
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.940
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.780
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:11.870
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.580
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.120
Okay!

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:18.580
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.710
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.800
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:31.850
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:34.890
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.770
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.630
Preview

00:23:41.410 --> 00:23:43.000
You're bringing a lot of luggage, Rin.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:43.760
Can I help you?

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:44.360
I'm fine.

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:45.320
Oh, let me.

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:46.210
H-Hey!

00:23:46.210 --> 00:23:48.060
Oh, no! I'm sorry!

00:23:48.060 --> 00:23:50.030
Is this all bean jelly?

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:51.020
Provisions.

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:52.780
Eating it together deepens our bonds.

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:54.570
Isn't this a lot?

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:57.560
Not really, nutritionally speaking.

00:23:57.560 --> 00:23:59.720
There is much protein in red beans.

00:23:59.720 --> 00:24:01.960
You sound like my mother.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:03.070
Q-Quiet.

00:24:03.070 --> 00:24:04.420
Go away.

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:09.630
War buddies never live long..

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:05.130
Next time.

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:07.960
War buddies never live long.

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:09.590
I want to disappear.
